{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams","id":28651,"title":"Dreams?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-12T05:37:50-08:00","id":28651,"title":"Dreams?","content":"Let's talk dreams!<br /> <br /> A few nights ago, I had a dream where I was a member on a special operations military-esque team. Our objective was to infiltrate this building and, I think, assassinate somebody. Two of my friends were also present, and the dream happened twice. The first time, I went with the male friend and we failed in sneaking in, so we shot our way through (the dream was somewhat like a video game). The second time, I went with my female friend and we succeeded on sneaking through. The dream was long, and detailed, with a beginning, middle and it. It was quite fun and interesting. It involved secret elevators and a labyrinth full of tigers.<br /> <br /> Last night, I had a dream where I told my dad all of the things I think he did wrong when he was raising me. And then I had a dream where I was trying to get my nephew to behave and he wouldn't. One of thing things I had told my dad was that I don't think you should spank kids, so I was trying to get my nephew to behave without hitting him. My sister said I should just hit him, but I was adamant. It was a terrible set of dreams and left me quite off-kilter upon waking. <br /> <br /> Does anybody else have dreams that they would like to share?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T06:17:11-08:00","id":28675,"title":"","content":"I have a recurring dream that I've been having for some months now. I think I know what it means, but it's stuck with me.<br /> <br /> It starts with me waking in a large, comfortable bed. The sheets are smoothest silk, the walls are rough but put together well, composed of logs like an old cabin. The floor is shale covered with a slew of rugs and throws. The walls have two windows, one facing east and looking out onto a smooth, clear-water pond with a rather large ridge rising up not far away, the other is to the north and looks out onto a flower and herb garden, a dirt path heading off into the trees that lie thick in that direction. I rise and enter the next room to find a large central living area, a comfortable kitchen and dining area attached. The furniture is all dark wood, the floor covers are much like the bedroom all in light furs that feel soft and smooth underfoot. More windows show the garden as before with some more to the east displaying trees beyond a sizeable vegetable patch.<br /> <br /> The air is filled with the smell of herbs and the front door is open. The sound of water trickles in and draws me outside, a beautiful cascade running down the ridge to the east provide the water that fills the pond next to the house. I can see a path leading up the ridge and a gentle sound from above mingles with that of the water. It draws me nearer and I begin to climb the path, my feet sinking slightly into the dirt of the path and I realize I've not put on a shirt or shoes. I shrug it off, the sound of a beautiful, honeyed voice singing drawing me on. My legs begin to burn pleasantly by the time I reach the top, the climb being steeper and longer than it seems. A second pond sits at the top of the path, surrounded on three sides by a wall of rocks that is obviously hand built, much thicker at the base than the top with no mortar to hold it in place. The sun shines through the old trees that tower over the scene and a water sits with her back to me, leaning down to run her fingers through the water. I think she hears me as her voice changes slightly, like she's smiling and I move closer. Her dress is simple and elegant, made of find blue cotton and cut to leave the shoulder closest me bare. Her hair is thick and long, simultaneously red and black despite the impossibility of it, and my eyes swim slightly trying to make sense of it. She turns and I feel the sensation of vibrant, golden eyes meeting mine, the impression of a welcoming smile... And then it ends and I wake up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","name":"CarnivalCash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T06:34:23-08:00","id":28683,"title":"","content":"I had one that Nathan Fillion had bought me an espresso machine, and I was trying to explain to him that though I appreciated the thought, I wouldn't use it because I dislike how bitter coffee is. He just kept smiling at me and asking if I like irony, because if I do, an espresso machine can make coffee taste like Nerds candy, which he brought up because Nerds candy is the flavor of irony. In my dream, I was willing to accept that irony had a flavor, but I couldn't think of a polite way to explain that I didn't want Nerds-flavored coffee either.<br /> <br /> I am sure my dream is portentous.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T06:54:31-08:00","id":28692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=28683#post28683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am sure my dream is portentous.</div> </div> </div> </div>Either that or you've been watching too much <i>Castle</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T07:03:45-08:00","id":28695,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=28683#post28683\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had one that Nathan Fillion had bought me an espresso machine, and I was trying to explain to him that though I appreciated the thought, I wouldn't use it because I dislike how bitter coffee is. He just kept smiling at me and asking if I like irony, because if I do, an espresso machine can make coffee taste like Nerds candy, which he brought up because Nerds candy is the flavor of irony. In my dream, I was willing to accept that irony had a flavor, but I couldn't think of a polite way to explain that I didn't want Nerds-flavored coffee either.<br /> <br /> I am sure my dream is portentous.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's means you're harboring a secret love of coffee.........<br /> <br /> .....and Nathan Fillion.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T07:08:05-08:00","id":28698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=28692#post28692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Either that or you've been watching too much <i>Castle</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't be silly, there's no such thing as too much Castle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T08:15:24-08:00","id":28738,"title":"","content":"been having the dream again. My jaw hurts when I wake up and my teeth hurt. I dreamed that my teeth had somehow been welded closed, top to bottom. I began trying to get them apart while my heart is beating faster and faster. Eventually, I break the bond but many teeth go with it. and I just feel my mouth fill with blood as I try to go and spit it out somewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T09:11:58-08:00","id":28760,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=28692#post28692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Either that or you've been watching too much <i>Castle</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> ...and he did play Hermes in a certain movie...<br /> <br /> Hmm...coincidence?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T09:28:58-08:00","id":28767,"title":"","content":"I haven't been having any specific dreams, but lately I've been hearing music in my dreams. That isn't terribly unusual; it's always happened to me a couple of times a year since I was a little kid. But lately it's been happening night after night. I hear classical music, rock music, punk, just about everything. It's kind of cool, but it can also be incredibly frustrating when I wake up and I can remember a song I heard in my sleep, but I can't remember the name of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T09:00:40-08:00","id":29348,"title":"","content":"I had a dream about a man who dreamed he had to build his body out of wood every night. When he was finished he transformed into the Minotaur but he was made of wood. Then he was transported to someone who needed help, was afraid and alone in the night. He knew he had to protect them from his spirit form. I woke up and immediately wrote the character into my chronicle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1482-aph","name":"aph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T09:32:27-08:00","id":29363,"title":"","content":"While on the train this morning, I had a dream wherein we engaged in feminist critique of <i>Wreck-It Ralph</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T10:23:07-08:00","id":29384,"title":"","content":"Yesterday during my nap, it was Highlander...complete with swords. Maybe it is telling me to get back on Netflix and watch the show.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T08:34:29-08:00","id":31691,"title":"","content":"Last night I had an Inception dream. In the second dream layer, my aunt showed my sister and me how to do some witchcraft. Afterward, we discovered that I had some ability with telekinesis. It was weak to start but she encouraged me to develop it. I quickly went from fairly weak to fairly powerful. It went from taking as much concentration as I could muster to do the simplest tasks to being able to type from a distance without any effort. Then I woke and was severely disappointed that I didn't actually have telekinesis. But I decided to try and discovered that I still did! But it was much weaker and didn't develop as quickly. I then woke again and realized that I did not, after all, have TK. Later, I had another dream where, over night, a garden with a menagerie of animals had grown in my parents' toilet. There were crickets in it, and anoles and chameleons. But I had to pee, so I started destroying it by peeing on it until I discovered an infant velociraptor. Then I tried destroying it by flushing it because, well, you can't have a baby velociraptor running around. Then I woke up. Still haven't tried to see whether I actually have telekinesis because this world feels realer than those ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T15:19:58-08:00","id":31929,"title":"","content":"I keep having a recurring dream that my teeth come loose and fall out, and I try to stick them back in and hold them in place in the hopes that the meaty bits will re-connect and heal. This has been going on for years.<br /> <br /> I played Ice Hockey in High School, and wonder if it's some kind of &quot;survivor guilt&quot; for getting through that with my smile in tact.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please add signature.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T06:43:43-08:00","id":33140,"title":"","content":"I have a recurring dream I call &quot;The Goblin Market&quot;. I'm in a store and suddenly I turn a corner and there are vintage Magic: The Gathering packs and Transformers from the 80s being sold at retail and RPG books I've never been able to find, etc. Today on the train, I had a dream that the train pulled into a station and the place was set up like the dealer's row at a Gaming Con.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-19T13:35:26-08:00","id":33371,"title":"","content":"Recently, I had a dream that an acquaintance of mine, who is a fisherman, was going to kill me with his knife and thereby bring down the European Union. Not quite sure about that one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-20T04:37:53-08:00","id":33788,"title":"","content":"Last night, I dreamed about Star Trek.<br /> <br /> More specifically, I dreamed that I was an extra on the first episode of The Next Generation. But it wasn't the first episode as we know it. It SUPER cheesy. It was filmed in front of a live studio audience, and they were laughing their asses off. I'm not sure whether it was supposed to be a comedy or not. But regardless, the plotline was completely different from the real first episode.<br /> <br /> The plotline of the episode in my dream had something to do with time travel. Captain Picard had Roman soldiers on his ship, and he was trying to tell them that the cold air was making them sick and that they needed to close the window on their front door. <br /> <br /> The costumes were incredibly cheesy. The Roman soldier costumes essentially looked like <a href=\"http://www.charliecrow.uk.com/_images/_images/xl/1078-roman_soldier_kids_costume_tabard.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>, only adult sized.<br /> <br /> Also, for some reason, the show was being filmed in the science building at my school. The bridge set had it's own room and had been built much like the bridge on the actual show, but there was a secondary set, which must have been the battle bridge, in the basement. This is where I was sitting. This wasn't a set at all. They pulled out a plastic chair for me to sit on. My &quot;costume&quot; was wearing a dark blue polo shirt with a small rocket logo on it. I was supposed to be a shuttle pilot. I was an extra, but I was sitting next to Troi at the front of the room. One of the actors, I can't remember who (maybe Frakes) set something on fire right before we started filming. <br /> <br /> At some point, I realized that this couldn't be happening because I was about a year old when the first episode actually came out. (In the dream I decided that I was three when it came out.) However, there was another student at the school here who was also working on the show, but as a creative consultant instead of an &quot;actor&quot;. I knew, somehow, that his life had been altered. That he was supposed to be an actor. And so, somehow I'd traveled back in time and altered history. After that, everything was okay.<br /> <br /> Later, in an unconnected dream, I had to fight off man-eating plants, deal with completely frictionless surfaces and a gel that made things super bouncy.<br /> <br /> WTF brain?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T16:05:40-08:00","id":35180,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Hanged Man</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=31929#post31929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I keep having a recurring dream that my teeth come loose and fall out, and I try to stick them back in and hold them in place in the hopes that the meaty bits will re-connect and heal. This has been going on for years.<br /> <br /> I played Ice Hockey in High School, and wonder if it's some kind of &quot;survivor guilt&quot; for getting through that with my smile in tact.</div> </div> </div> </div>I know that particular dream, though It's been a lot worse since I had some wisdom teeth taken out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T16:49:41-08:00","id":35201,"title":"","content":"A team composed by an Abyssal, a Solar and an Infernal conquer a pizza restaurant after defeating the owner, a hipster guy with mind control powers.<br /> <br /> Later, Ben Grimm from the Fantastic Four, being hungry because of cosmic shenanigans, buys a pizza but does not like it very much. The story ends with the Thing, wearing a proper chef hat, teaching the Exalted how to make a good pizza and with all of them eating it like one happy bunch of sitcom friends. Roll credits.<br /> <br /> Yeah, that was weird.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T06:16:08-08:00","id":36328,"title":"","content":"I dreamed last night that Arc and I were at a church activity, and he was drinking Coke, but acting as if it were beer; to some Mormons, the taboo on drinking either is similar, and Arc was playing that up. He then asked me if I would go and grab him another Coke, so I went to do so. Whilst I was searching for one, he came to the place of food, where there were about 15 boxes of pizza. He grabbed about five, loudly announced, &quot;All your pizza are belong to us!&quot; and returned to the table with them. I want you all to know that this dream is ludicrous and would never happen in real life... Arc would never ask me to go get him another Coke.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T06:27:29-08:00","id":36337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=36328#post36328\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dreamed last night that Arc and I were at a church activity, and he was drinking Coke, but acting as if it were beer; to some Mormons, the taboo on drinking either is similar, and Arc was playing that up. He then asked me if I would go and grab him another Coke, so I went to do so. Whilst I was searching for one, he came to the place of food, where there were about 15 boxes of pizza. He grabbed about five, loudly announced, &quot;All your pizza are belong to us!&quot; and returned to the table with them. I want you all to know that this dream is ludicrous and would never happen in real life... Arc would never ask me to go get him another Coke.</div> </div> </div> </div>Right, he'd go get the Coke himself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T07:32:35-08:00","id":36367,"title":"","content":"Last night, I had a dream that I had gone camping with family and friends. The road was insanely bumpy, and, as dream logic goes, I drove up the ramp of the camp office and into the building. I ended up on the rafters over the porch, watching below as my wife met with our friends to organize our things. A spider, yellow-orange and black and larger than her hand descended from the light and landed on her. I shouted and she tried to brush it off, but it clung to her so I shouted again and she tore it apart with her bare hands. Then a spider started crawling up my arm and I woke up. Friggin' Hobbit movie.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-24T07:37:27-08:00","id":36368,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_post