t that her HP Envy hard drive crashed. She was calling her ex to help her out (get the HD from the PS3 and slide it in there with recovery discs.) Now I want to get back to that dream because it might make a good thriller short story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-30T09:21:35-08:00","id":39429,"title":"","content":"Last night, I had another sci-fi dream. We were having some sort of activity, a picnic or something, on another planet. It was to take place in a small shack. And the shack was located in a place that was very cold and snowy. I feel like the entire planet was an ice planet, like Hoth, but perhaps that was not true. I felt like, in the dream, that I had had a dream in this place before, and I knew what was going to happen: there was going to be some sort of yeti/wampa/abominable snowman that was going to attack the gathering. (People were standing in line, like you do at Disneyland or some other place where you have dividers and have to stand in line for extended periods of time.) So I took measures to preempt this happening, but I was younger than I am in real life; I feel like I was 12 or so. We (I'm not sure who &quot;we&quot; consists of, but there were others I convinced to come along) tried to cause the entrance to the lair of the beast to collapse. I think we were successful. <br /> <br /> Overnight, an entire city sprung up around this little shack which was in the middle of nowhere. I had some sort of device that allowed me to fly, it was akin to a balloon or a parachute, and I was flying through the streets of this city. There were all sorts of Christmas lights and decorations up; it was kind of like The Grinch movie. <br /> <br /> I took this parachute and I flew out over this huge cliff, thousands of feet of drop off beneath me. There was a very fancy hotel embedded into the side of the cliff. I did some flying around and then I woke up to a freezing house.<br /> <br /> The night before last, I had a dream about going on an opulent, Regency era themed cruise with my Sexy Mexican friend. The ship was enormous, with solid wood, chandeliers and red carpet everywhere. It was gorgeous. There were grand staircases that swung around and moved a la (movie) Hogwarts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-03T04:59:09-08:00","id":41647,"title":"","content":"Last night was filled with horribly unpleasant dreams.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link"