t honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-07T05:38:04-08:00","id":44097,"title":"","content":"I need to lay off watching scooby doo shows...that is all the kids watch when they come over to spend the night (or pokemon or Ben 10, we get Hub). I can't dream at night but when I nap I do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T21:20:07-08:00","id":46047,"title":"","content":"My alarm clock startled me awake from a dream that I remember nothing of save the very last thing that happened: A woman sitting on a shower chair, the kind with a U-shaped seat like a toilet seat, began peeing in a wide, conical spray like her vagina was a fire sprinkler. I have no context for where this was or why it was happening, nor who the woman was, but based on how tightly the camera of my mind was zoomed in on this image, I assume my face was pretty much right there in it. The tip of my nose couldn't have been too fa