t-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T13:13:59-08:00","id":49243,"title":"","content":"... On a lighter note, my weird dream from last night was that I was suddenly rich and famous for some odd reason, and that I had a famous baseball player (and his wife) come over to do... something, I don't know.<br /> <br /> I was in my room at some point, surfing the internet I think, when Sean Connery called. He told me I should really do something about those webcams in my refrigerator, like cover them up or something. I thanked him, and then I completely blanked when I tried to think of something else to say. I didn't want to just end the call because it's frickin' Sean Connery, but the only thing I could think of to do would be to introduce him to the baseball player. I would have done this, but I was too embarrassed to do so because I had forgotten the baseball player's name.<br /> <br /> After all, I don't even watch baseball.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Joi