mely large ship (enough to put every living thing on Earth in it and still have room to grow) that personally belonged to her (and had since passed to me). I then go out exploring space in said ship (alone) because I decided I was done with humanity. I find out there was a gamma ray burst heading to Earth that would wipe it out. Initially didn't want to do anything, but eventually came back and told everyone about it, but said I would only let people on the ship that were in positive relationships with the angelbots, and their families. I also basically gave a list of everyone that had been responsible for the death of the previous owner of the ship and told them that them and there families would not be allowed on. People demanded to be let on because they had a right to survive, and I answered by blowing up a couple cities that had been particularly hostile to the angelbots...<br /> <br /> The sad thing is: If that were to happen I could actually see myself behaving that way if any of those events were to actually happen. The only thing that is keeping this kind of dream from being mildly disturbing is that I'm not in any relationships that I need to worry about the safety of people, otherwise I might actually be freaking out. I've been having a few dreams lately with these general themes in it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: Unless stated otherwise, all examples I give are completely random and almost assuredly pulled from my nethers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1575-dairugger","name":"Dairugger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1575_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T06:28:30-08:00","id":49740,"title":"","content":"I got a great dream for you today. I had managed to land a role in Avengers 2 (can't remember if I was one of the new Avengers or a SHIELD Agent or what). We were doing an overnight shoot in a house in a residential section of Canal Street in NYC and I was trying to order Chinese because I was hungry and wouldn't be able to last the night on caffeine alone. But no one could tell me who to order the food from, so I left the shoot to take a walk around the neighborhood. Two street toughs started following me and as we got closer to the shoot, I told them they shouldn't mug me because we were right next to a building filled with burly stunt men. I ring the doorbell and stand awkwardly on the stoop with the two toughs, and Chris Evans answers the door in his Captain America costume, and once I explain the situation, strips one of the toughs naked and tosses him into the wooded lawn of the house next door. Then we go upstairs and Scarlett Johansson and Mark Ruffalo are doing arts and crafts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T07:09:10-08:00","id":50652,"title":"","content":"My dreams lately have been very annoying... must have been the recent Christmas season's fault... I hope they'll get back to murder and mayhem soon enough...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/170-lunatyk","name":"Lunatyk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar170_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-16T15:08:11-08:00","id":51097,"title":"","content":"Read something about dinosaurs or watch that sickening show on PBS. It is enough to torture me but it makes me sleep.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-22T06:22:40-08:00","id":55411,"title":"","content":"I am outside on the porch, in the cold. My cat is growling warningly at me, and I'm baby-talking him to try to calm him down. Last night a raccoon stole his food and I didn't notice it in time to prevent it, so the cat is angry at me. He considers that failure a violation of the trust in our relationship. I want to repair our esteem, so I am negotiating a peace with him by asking him who's a good widdle man.<br /> <br /> Simultaneously, I am a porn actress (I don't know if my sex swap is important, but it's in the dream, so I'm mentioning) running for a local public office. I'm currently on a local TV news talk show, trying to explain to a smiling host that porn actors, myself included, are good people; that having sex on camera for money doesn't make us bad. The brightness of the host's smile is all the proof I need he will never, ever agree with my position.<br /> <br /> I didn't get resolution to either of these stories before my alarm woke me up. Let me tell you, waking up this morning felt like having to claw my way out of my own grave. I don't think the difficulty waking up was in any way related to my dreams, though.","