v> </div>I don't know where that came from, either, but I wanna live where the Hawai'ian born black president sings Irish/Scottish folk songs on the radio.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":375,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","user":"Papa Bear","date":". 01-30-2014, 11:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-30T08:44:31-08:00","id":61568,"title":"","content":"Oh it was Irish it was the traditional/Clancy Brothers one (the Metallica cover would have just been <i>weird</i>).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ortam + Malkavia makes a Requiem fun.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Posts in this colour are Persuasion.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">Posts in this colour are Seduction.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this colour are Intimidation.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/57-solomon-birch","name":"solomon birch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar57_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"289"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-12T06:03:00-08:00","id":70523,"title":"","content":"Last night I had a series of the most bizarre dreams I've ever had. I spent the first half of the night chasing a pixie. We tried several different methods of capturing it. I can't remember in the end whether we caught it or not.<br /> <br /> This was followed up by a Jurassic Park dream. Literally, I was in Jurassic Park. Dennis Nedry had stolen the dino embryos and sold them. And the company to which he'd sold them did something to them and crossed them with other animals. So, we had like half bear half dinosaur creatures that were wandering around suburbia America. There was also something about a houseboat which was being dragged down river toward a waterfall by a giant river-dwelling reptile. There were two human-raptors inside.<br /> <br /> Then I &quot;woke up&quot; and people kept telling me that it was after 15:00 and that I'd missed all of my classes. I told them it couldn't be after 15:00 because it was night time. <br /> <br /> Then I was with my family, and my uncle wanted to go to dinner one place, but my dad had planned to go to dinner another place. My grandmother, who is dead, was there (but not dead in the dream). <br /> <br /> So... yeah. Bizarre.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-12T10:10:00-08:00","id":70669,"title":"","content":"It means you love your mother too much......or not enough.......or not.......or both.......or something else.........yeah, something like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-12T16:42:23-08:00","id":70918,"title":"","content":"I had a dream involving Fae. I was doing the mopy routine when I walk-in to my closet (Yes, I actually have one) and suddenly find my self on some crazy advanced spacecraft With a bunch of pixies floating about mentioning something about an offering. I get taken to the queen of this crazy kingdom (I also learned that if given something, give something back of value because saying &quot;thank you&quot; was rude) who acts like a the craziest counselor I've ever had and yet everything made sense when looked a holistically. She then ate my negative emotions because she needed &quot;the salt.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Disclaimer: Unless stated otherwise, all examples I give are completely random and almost assuredly pulled from my nethers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1575-dairugger","name":"Dairugger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1575_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T07:07:16-08:00","id":71253,"title":"","content":"I don't know if this is the right thread to talk about it, because I was awake for most of what I'm about to describe, but last night was kind of hellish. Every time I was about to fall asleep, I dreamed...I don't know exactly what I dreamed, but it was something about an enemy samurai was in bed with me and trying to kill me. The only thing I remember clearly is the knowledge that I had to deal with that enemy samurai. It happened over and over and over, and I don't remember if it was the same samurai trying to murder me every time or if it was a different one, though I'm pretty sure at one point the emperor himself (I don't know which emperor) was my enemy to face.<br /> <br /> Every time it happened, there was this buzzing itch in my heart that I desperately wanted to scratch but couldn't because of the obvious problem of my ribcage. At one point I gave up on sleep entirely and just went to the bathroom to sit on the toilet in the dark, scratching my chest. I was in there doing that for at least half an hour.<br /> <br /> Usually, this kind of delusional state only happens when I get really sick, but nothing seems to have been wrong. I can't explain it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T13:56:24-08:00","id":71590,"title":"","content":"It wasn't a dream, Jim. The samurai actually <i>were</i> trying to kill you, and when your brain opened up to its greater capacity on the edge of sleep, you were able to see through their invisibility cloaks. Fortunately you were able to fight them off. So good on you Jim. You <i>may</i> have scared them away. I hope they don't return tonight.<br /> <br /> (If this is making light of your hellish night, and you think it inappropriate, please forgive me and let me know. I'll delete it.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T14:25:31-08:00","id":71617,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=71590#post71590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If this is making light of your hellish night, and you think it inappropriate, please forgive me and let me know. I'll delete it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, you're cool. As far as I'm concerned, anything is fair game to joke about, except for the things that aren't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T14:33:06-08:00","id":71621,"title":"","content":"So it's ok to point out you've had dreams where you're a female, and now there's a samurai in your bed? (I'm assuming the samurai was a he, historically). Mayhaps he is in league with the racoons?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ortam + Malkavia makes a Requiem fun.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Posts in this colour are Persuasion.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">Posts in this colour are Seduction.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this colour are Intimidation.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/57-solomon-birch","name":"solomon birch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar57_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"289"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-13T15:24:55-08:00","id":71659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>solomon birch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=71621#post71621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So it's okay to point out you've had dreams where you're a female[...]</div> </div> </div> </div>It would be kind of a dick move to tell the stories if it wasn't okay for you to reference them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>solomon birch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=71621#post71621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[...]and now there's a samurai in your bed? (I'm assuming the samurai was a he, historically).</div> </div> </div> </div>In all fairness, I'm not sure he was/they were so much in my bed as occupying a conceptual spatial coordinate that I could detect from my bed. You know how dreams are.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>solomon birch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=71621#post71621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mayhaps he is in league with the racoons?</div> </div> </div> </div>I feel like there's a tanooki's testicles joke in there somewhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T02:15:19-08:00","id":78193,"title":"","content":"Been dream-hallucinating all night. I'm afraid to go back to bed. I keep...the dreams are about me, where I'm all the people of a horrible, crime-ridden city, or maybe I should say they're all me. I don't know. I am also cards in a deck, and each card being played forces another one to be played. The cards are degradations the people-selves of the crime-ridden city have to inflict on themselves in order to survive, compromising themselves by acting as spies and accomplices just in order to stay safe. When one of the me-people of the city tries to break the cycle by getting free of the influence of the card-crimes, they are killed, buried under an avalanche of playing cards and left for the families to cripple themselves financially paying for a funeral that leaves them in a vulnerable position to the crimes in the deck of cards.<br /> <br /> I have died so many times tonight. I've been someone who just wanted to help up an old woman who fell down on the street, and a virginal young activist who wanted to make life better for people whose last thought as he bled out was that his heart was breaking he never even had a chance to fall in love before he died, and dozens of others who passed so fast while I was busy being everyone in a city (and a deck of cards) that I can't remember them. It took me about an hour and a half to claw my way awake, and the clawing was literal as I kept thrashing around in bed to force myself to get up. Every time I tried to sit up, I'd fall back over on my side, so I looked like I was doing some weird bastardization of the Curly Shuffle. Kept talking to myself trying to wake myself up, and though I remember the things I said, I don't know what they meant. &quot;Vitruvius, not Vesuvius, who's Vitruvius?&quot; I announced to the room at one point. At another, I was trying to sing the words to <b>the Pink Panther</b>'s theme song, which I'm pretty sure doesn't have words, but I was kind of desperate for noises to wake me up.<br /> <br /> This is all because of whatever's going on in my stomach; my brain is fried by fever. Cold is crawling over my skin like fingers and my feet are so tender that walking hurts, but none of that seems important next to all the goddamned cards being played in my bed. I really wish I could throw up and have done with it.<br /> <br /> Ugh, fuck it, I'm exhausted and more or less lucid. I'm taking my chances and going to bed again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T11:42:10-08:00","id":81699,"title":"","content":"I had a dream about a scholar who believed that Hitler could have won WWII if he had just launched Operation Sea Lion with one minor alteration, so he built a time machine to go back to 1939 and prove it. His time machine ceased to exist and he was stuck in a timeline where the Nazis conquered the Earth, trying to clandestinely build a new time machine with which to go back and stop himself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-28T12:52:05-08:00","id":81740,"title":"","content":"Sounds like an episode of <b>the Twilight Zone</b> (or, as some comedian or another argues the show ought to have been named, <b>Nice Try, Asshole</b>).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T01:02:21-08:00","id":81998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=81699#post81699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had a dream about a scholar who believed that Hitler could have won WWII if he had just launched Operation Sea Lion with one minor alteration, so he built a time machine to go back to 1939 and prove it. His time machine ceased to exist and he was stuck in a timeline where the Nazis conquered the Earth, trying to clandestinely build a new time machine with which to go back and stop himself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice. Why don't they make that into a movie?<br /> <br /> I drifted in and out of sleep while cuddling with my girlfriend on the couch tonight. During this time, I was having conversations with people who were, in fact, not present, and would realize this as I drifted back toward consciousness and realized that I wasn't actually speaking aloud. (Though sometimes, I would be nodding, which is weird when you're lying with your head on somebody's shoulder/breast and they can't see or hear the person you're talking to.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-05T12:24:32-08:00","id":84776,"title":"","content":"Last night I dreamed that I was hanging out with Mark Harmon(1) playing Magic: the Gathering(2) and drinking beers(3). I made a joke about the movie Top Gun, and he mentioned that he'd never seen it, and I tried to describe it to him, but I made it sound like a romance between Maverick and Iceman, especially the scene where they're playing volleyball shirtless but in jeans. Then this impossibly enormous lady covered in open sores started yelling at us for making too many clinking noises with our beer bottles, and her voice was so loud that it rattled the picnic table we were playing on several feet, and shifted a bunch of my Magic cards back to an active state so I could use them the next turn, but Mark Harmon didn't notice. Then I woke up before I could use this advantage to crush him.<br /> <br /> 1 - I haven't watched an NCIS episode in four or five years.<br /> 2 - I haven't played M:tG since the year 2000, when I sold all my cards.<br /> 3 - I don't drink <i>at all</i>, and could only identify dream beer by scent.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please add signature.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/615-the-hanged-man","name":"The Hanged Man","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T02:24:07-07:00","id":90757,"title":"","content":"I had a dream this night which was kind of strange. It wasn't about anything in particular: there was a recap of a web comic happening, appearently with real-life actors or just the actual characters from the comic. Then I was in a gameshow for kids, and I got points for the wrong answers. The most prominent thing in the dream, though, was this sense of nostalgia, an air of fond memories and a slight sadness over times past that I can't quite correlate to the visual impressions the dream had. It wasn't unpleasant, but kind of... unmotivated?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-14T10:56:26-07:00","id":90980,"title":"","content":"I recently had a dream where I was Batman in some art gallery or museum or other fighting the League of Shadows. All of them. I knew it was my last fight, so I abandoned the &quot;no guns and killing&quot; policy. Unfortunately, they had recruited a 12-year old who poisoned my grapnel escape route. I had to crash through a window into the river, swam a few blocks, crawled into a secret hollow in a tree that concealed an entrance to the Batcave with pine needles from Gotham Botanical Gardens. I pressed the secret button to go home and then woke up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-02T21:31:08-07:00","id":104577,"title":"","content":"I was at a school. The elevator has three buttons, despite the school only having two floors. I was with a girl, I don't remember who. We pushed the extra button and the elevator started dropping faster and faster. Eventually it stopped and the doors opened. Standing, facing away from us, were 3 (?) men dressed in Victorian wear, top hats and such. The elevator had taken us into the past. The room was like an arcade, but they were focused on a thing that looked like an oven. They were putting a man into it. We (the girl and I) tried to escape, but they captured her. They forced her to watch as they pulled the skeleton of the man from the oven.<br /> <br /> I rescued her and we were able to successfully board the elevator and start going up. However, one of the men was on an elevator in the same shaft above us. He went to another door, higher than the school, which was a couple of days into the future. I followed him. The school was burning and he was killing the last witnesses. He noticed me, and followed me back to the present. He didn't capture me, but I had to leave my shoes behind. He wore them as he started the flames and framed me.<br /> <br /> Later, seemingly disconnected. I was at a friend's house. He knew about the situation and he was resigned to let it happen. He had a staircase that went down 18 floors into that past room in his house. Eago, yes from Aladdin, came up the stairs. Somehow I thought we could prevent the event from happening. We grabbed Eago and I was going to do whatever it was I thought would help. But I decided to discuss it with my friend. We left Eago in someone else's care and went to discuss it. I told him my plan and he said, &quot;We barely got you out of there. There's no guarantee you won't get trapped again.&quot; I reluctantly assented and we went to go kill Eago. But we couldn't find him. He'd put everyone to sleep and escaped. We began searching. At this point I woke.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":1041,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","user":"brjedi26","date":". 04-03-2014, 12:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T08:06:58-07:00","id":111489,"title":"","content":"Tonight I dreamed that I woke up with a mouth full of vomit, which was really unpleasant. Soon, however, I realised that it was actually the Bread of the Gods, so it wasn't quite as bad as I thought.<br /> <br /> That was the dream. That was all of the dream.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T09:11:22-07:00","id":111528,"title":"","content":"Weird dream.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-12T17:28:12-07:00","id":111833,"title":"","content":"Particularly since I usually dream about pretty mundane stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-15T13:51:40-07:00","id":113533,"title":"","content":"I've been having some real winners, Inception type nightmares within nightmares the last couple of weeks. I've finally figured out the trick, if lightswitches don't work I'm dreaming. I had a weird non nightmare for a change, my mother and I were in the kitchen of the house I grew up in, she went to go into the dining room and started yelling for me to get in there. I went in and saw a young version of my deceased grandmother, who I was extremely close to, playing a piano where the couch should be in the living room. She looked over, smiled at us then started to fade out, with a bright flash of light as she disappeared. The weird thing eas how real it felt, not like a dream at all. I called my mom the next day and asked if my grandmother ever played the piano, because I never saw her play one when she was alive, and my mom said she used to play quite beautifully and enjoyed playing a lot when my mom was a kid. Can't say I didn't tear up a little when I heard that, too bad I don't believe in an afterlife, it would be nice to think my grandmother was still around somewhere doing something she enjoyed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-25T07:05:12-07:00","id":119090,"title":"","content":"So the dream started out with my mom and dad waking me up to take me somewhere. It was a surprise, but on the drive they told me it was going to involve looking at rocks and I got the impression that it was going to be hiking. It was early in the morning, like 4:00 and I hadn't changed out of my pajamas because I didn't know we were going to be doing stuff. I was pissed. When we got there, I was really belligerent and told them that I was not going to look at these rocks. I walked away. Dad followed me to try to change my mind, and I ended up at a gas station. It was cold, and I sat in the entrance of the gas station between two sets of doors. They were apparently doing some sort of trivia thing and you answered via text message. They had some way of texting the question to everyone within a certain radius of the gas station.<br /> Meanwhile, my mom and brother were looking at the rock things. It was this little old place with crystals that were in the shapes of galaxies. The place was run by and old, greying couple. They were going around looking at the rocks, and they were pretty cool. The details of my memory are fuzzy here and I'm not sure what exactly happened. I think my brother released a ghost and it possessed him. Mom found out about this and agreed to let it possess her if it would leave him, so it did.<br /> Dad and I went back and looked at the crystals. The sun was rising and the place was closing and so we got back into the car to head home. I realized that there was something wrong with mom and found out that she was possessed by a ghost. At this point I realized that I was a demon, and, being a more powerful spiritual entity, I threatened the ghost that I would destroy its essence if it refused to release my mother. It released her, but now everyone knew that I was a demon. Here again, the details get fuzzy. We went back home and I marked up some (I think they were cookie cutters? wtf?) with arcane symbols related to trapping the ghost... or something.<br /> That was the first dream.<br /> <br /> I feel like the second was related to the first, but the characters weren't the same, so I don't know how it would be.<br /> It was a farmhouse and there was a mother and a father and I was there (though I don't know if I was me) and a younger brother. The house was old and gothic in style and there was a crypt beneath it. Again, I think that the younger brother released a demon from the crypt beneath the house. It hopped from host to host and ended up in a goat on the farm. It was content to remain there.<br /> However, the mother and the father found out that there was a demon in the goat and the mother insisted that the father kill said goat. So the father went out with a shotgun to kill it. Of course, a shotgun doesn't matter to a demon, so it jumped to the father, and then shot the goat. The mother was satisfied that the demon was taken care of, but I knew that it was now in the father. (Outside of the window, I saw him staring at me. He had the shotgun held loosely in his left hand, and in his right he held the slain goat by the neck. His eyes were glowing red and bored into my soul. It was terrifying.)<br /> The demon was now unsure as to what it was going to do. It didn't want to keep the father as a host, but the goat which it had been content possessing was now dead. It had a couple of options. It could possess a person, or it could haunt a location. The location which it could haunt was the house. I was in the living room as it was contemplating haunting the house. Typical scary things: a shadow from behind, but when you turn around there's no source, scraping at the window with no apparent cause, etc.<br /> And... that's all I really remember.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":1041,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","user":"brjedi26","date":". 04-26-2014, 01:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T00:54:41-07:00","id":120818,"title":"","content":"Been having the same hallucination for weeks now. Something in my brain keeps pulling up these horrifyingly vivid sounds and images of people being tortured by having teeth removed one by one with no anesthetic, and having metal stints with braces strung between them installed in the still-bleeding wounds.<br /> <br /> The part that makes it the worst for me is I can smell the blood, hear the noises, and I swear to God almost see the people while I'm awake. It's worse when I sleep. Then I'm watching it happen in this dingy, nasty, ratty apartment that looks like something out of the Texas Chainsaw Massacre.<br /> <br /> I really wish this was out of the ordinary for me, but the only thing that makes it unusual is that it's continuing while I'm awake.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sure, there's no way to canonically do it, but Exalted allows you to knee canon in the crotch and rifle through its pockets to take what you need while it whimpers on the ground. - mockery","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/374-nocte-ex-mortis","name":"Nocte ex Mortis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar374_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T05:06:27-07:00","id":120887,"title":"","content":"Er, that...that sounds like something to go to the doctor for, Nocte.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T08:41:05-07:00","id":120950,"title":"","content":"Nah, it stopped about four hours after I posted that. I have slightly altered brain chemistry to begin with so auditory hallucinations are not unusual. The kicker for this was that I was in a manic state at the same time, so my mind was in overdrive. I knew it was fake, and could easily separate out the signals, but it was just... odd.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Sure, there's no way to canonically do it, but Exalted allows you to knee canon in the crotch and rifle through its pockets to take what you need while it whimpers on the ground. - mockery","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/374-nocte-ex-mortis","name":"Nocte ex Mortis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar374_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"486"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-30T05:47:39-07:00","id":122284,"title":"","content":"I was Spider-Man, crawling on the walls outside the prison on Ryker's Island, asking prisoners to lean their heads out through the windows so I could wash their hair, like Jesus ministering to the poor by washing their feet. I was carrying a glass pitcher of water for the purpose. Occasionally I would come across a crack in the wall, and I would try to patch it, but I lacked any spackle or construction material, so I would just stuff live puppies into it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T21:22:51-07:00","id":124271,"title":"","content":"I almost had a migraine this morning. As I have mentioned often enough on the old forums, I know some techniques to stave off a migraine and prevent it from occurring, but they have a price: I will be wired for a few hours as my body dumps buttloads of endorphins into my bloodstream to counteract the pain and stress of the upcoming migraine, but once that rush wears off, I crash hard. By the time I got home, I was a numb-brained zombie who only barely had enough wherewithal to do my ritual forum-surfing before stumbling to bed at seven in the evening.<br /> <br /> I just woke up. I was kind of kneeling beside the bed when I woke up, though my weight was only on my right knee, because my left leg was hiked up into bed, so I looked kind of like a dog taking a piss. My arms were under my head like a student taking a nap at his desk.<br /> <br /> No idea how I got that way.<br /> <br /> Going back to bed now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T06:57:11-07:00","id":128204,"title":"","content":"This dream isn't pornographic or anything, but it does involve some fairly intimate displays of affection that might make you uncomfortable.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Scarlett Johansson and I were cuddled up on a couch together. We'd originally been just relaxing and watching a movie, but she and I were old friends who hadn't seen each other in a very long time, and we missed each other. Maybe snuggling up together was a weird response, like something people dating would do, but it also seemed right. We were friends and we wanted the comfort of touching and being touched, and if that crossed some artificial line of what behavior was okay for friends, who cared? It was just cuddling, after all. It wasn't like we were touching each other anywhere you wouldn't touch, say, your sister's baby.<br /> <br /> ...At first.<br /> <br /> I needed to get up for something, but as I began the effort I realized I really, really did not want to leave my friend and kind of flopped back down on the couch in the middle of trying to leave. As it worked out, my face had landed in Scarlett's lap, which made her giggle. I found that funny because she's not really the giggling type, and a feeling of warmth swept over me. I turned my face to the side a little bit and realized that at this point I was just plain nuzzling her and should stop, so of course I just kissed the inside of her knee and she shifted a little to let me do it. It still felt a little weird to be doing this to my friend, but the moment felt right, and in a moment of great clarity I thought, <i>It doesn't matter that you're friends. Labels don't matter. The important thing is that you love her and she loves you, and neither of you wants to trick the other one or to hurt the other one. Just let love be love.</i><br /> <br /> So, for the first time in my life, I was going to have sex with someone without fear and shame as a component. That the person I'd be with was Scarlett Johansson was a nice enough bonus to be worth mentioning, but that was all the thought merited by being with maybe the most beautiful woman in the world. The important thing was feeling safe and feeling loved with a friend, and my kisses started climbing uphill as she parted her legs a little more because she was feeling the same way.<br /> <br /> Then my phone rang and woke me up.<br /> <br /> It was a friend, texting me that today will be a bad day for him but he didn't want to talk about why. So basically, he texted me to say he didn't want to talk.<br /> <br /> I may murder him. Probably shouldn't announce that on the internet, but I may plant a bomb in his fucking apartment this afternoon.<br /> <br /> God damn it.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> EDIT: She was Scarlett Johansson, but in that weird way dreams do, she was also Natasha Romanov. Early in the dream, while she and I were catching up, I asked her if Tony Stark was able to get a hold of her; she tensed a little and asked why I wanted to know. I told her I'd watched <b>Iron Man 3</b> and kept saying to myself, &quot;A lot of these problems could be solved by a Black Widow,&quot; which made her laugh. Not really relevant to the overall point of the story, but something I wanted to point out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":271,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","user":"JimB","date":". 05-08-2014, 10:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T11:12:50-07:00","id":128378,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=128204#post128204\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">She was Scarlett Johansson, but in that weird way dreams do, she was also Natasha Romanov.</div> </div> </div> </div>...Guldurnit, why can't I have sexy dreams about Scarlett Johansson?! It's always weird stuff like getting awkward calls from Sean Connery, or a younger version of my Dad trying to kill Santa Claus.<br /> <br /> Edit: Seriously, JimB, if I don't dream about Scarlett Johansson tonight, I'm blaming you. Just saying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 05-08-2014, 02:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-08T16:05:41-07:00","id":128595,"title":"","content":"Jim, that sounds like an awesome dream up until the waking up part. Your friend really does deserve a stern talking to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T06:09:01-07:00","id":128900,"title":"","content":"I had a dream last night that one room of the house I was living in(which in this dream was my parents house I think) was haunted. Every time I was in there, I'd see a vague shadowlike figure who would yell at me to &quot;GET OUT&quot; and then pushes and drags me around until I leave the room.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T06:37:05-07:00","id":128908,"title":"","content":"Was it a creepy dream, or something else?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T10:08:22-07:00","id":129055,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=128908#post128908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Was it a creepy dream, or something else?</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know. I don't remember it being real creepy, just bizarre...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T12:10:05-07:00","id":129161,"title":"","content":"I have been seriously considering finding a book on dream interpretation and looking back at this thread. I realize dream interpretation is a load of hooey, but I thought it would be an interesting...experiment, for lack of a better word.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T17:46:33-07:00","id":129435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=129161#post129161\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have been seriously considering finding a book on dream interpretation and looking back at this thread. I realize dream interpretation is a load of hooey, but I thought it would be an interesting...experiment, for lack of a better word.</div> </div> </div> </div>FOR SCIENCE!<br /> <br /> Last night I dreampt I was sleeping behind my desk at work (it's a huge reception desk) in about 2 feet of warm water. All other floors and the rest of the area was dry. Just behind my desk, 2 ft of comfy water and a blanket. And a baby aligator trying to crawl underneath my side to stay warm, but then it turned out to be my cat crawling out from under the dream blanket, wet and annoyed. Then I woke up. I do own a cat, but he does not sleep in my room.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T19:05:19-07:00","id":129503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=129435#post129435\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> FOR SCIENCE!<br /> <br /> Last night I dreampt I was sleeping behind my desk at work (it's a huge reception desk) in about 2 feet of warm water. All other floors and the rest of the area was dry. Just behind my desk, 2 ft of comfy water and a blanket. And a baby aligator trying to crawl underneath my side to stay warm, but then it turned out to be my cat crawling out from under the dream blanket, wet and annoyed. Then I woke up. I do own a cat, but he does not sleep in my room.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, let me take a crack at this:<br /> <br /> - The presence of water in an otherwise dry area refers to some sort of setback - or setbacks ahead - in your particular line of work. The fact that the rest of your floor is dry suggests that you are the only one &quot;feeling the heat&quot;. Comfy water...that's a trickier one, but if it has a blanket, it might be symbolic of a bed; the strangeness of water as a bed to sleep in suggests that, even though the water looks &quot;comfy&quot;, there is going to be an upturn in your current affairs. Though again, the bizarre comfy nature might suggest it's in your favour?<br /> <br /> - Sleeping at work suggests some sort of an illness or perhaps a means of escaping reality. Combined with the above symbolism, there's is something you want to escape, but things are shaking up in your work world, and work is hitting closer to home.<br /> <br /> - The alligator is a sign of warning, some sort of threat in your life. The alligator turning into a cat could be signs that the oncoming threat will somehow betray you, but because it was a pet cat you saw, there could be an element of closeness between you and the betrayer \u2014 perhaps some sort of companion is responsible? The blanket is apparently another element of warning, and everything about the cat turning into the alligator...that entire sequence is a big red flag of someone you know, possibly a friend or companion, betraying you in some way through trickery. And shake-ups at work are either part of the problem or happening alongside it.<br /> <br /> TL;DR: Someone's turned on you because of work, or someone's turned on you during problems at work (both of which might be hitting close to home), and you feel a need to escape. That's what I managed to pull from this dream.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T19:36:57-07:00","id":129531,"title":"","content":"Hmmm that was very interesting Sikla. Though it was the other way around the Alligator became a Cat. So does that mean the enemy is becoming my friend? Does size factor into it? Because the baby alligator I had the first impression of was about 5 or 6 inches long. Just a tiny baby, while my cat is about 2 feet long and a hefty 14 pounds. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Reflecting upon work I can't say there's much setbacks, but certainly I'm not moving forward. Stagnant, but I'm ok with that. It's an easy job and pays the bills. Maybe that's why the water is comfy? I do find more quiet time at work to do thigns I want. Like read or happen to be posting on RPG forums *cough cough* ^_^ At home I just cook, clean house and watch TV with one of my room mates. There is some strain because my work hours and working weekends doesn't exactly let me be as social as my other friends would like me to be with them, but none of them are related to my job in the sense they can betray me or cause problems with work. though we are about to expand my work site to more floors. That's the only shake-up coming down the line though. So Hmmmmm. All very thought provoking. Thank you for that Sikla. *snugs*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T19:58:34-07:00","id":129546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=129531#post129531\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm that was very interesting Sikla. Though it was the other way around the Alligator became a Cat. So does that mean the enemy is becoming my friend? Does size factor into it? Because the baby alligator I had the first impression of was about 5 or 6 inches long. Just a tiny baby, while my cat is about 2 feet long and a hefty 14 pounds. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Reflecting upon work I can't say there's much setbacks, but certainly I'm not moving forward. Stagnant, but I'm ok with that. It's an easy job and pays the bills. Maybe that's why the water is comfy? I do find more quiet time at work to do thigns I want. Like read or happen to be posting on RPG forums *cough cough* ^_^ At home I just cook, clean house and watch TV with one of my room mates. There is some strain because my work hours and working weekends doesn't exactly let me be as social as my other friends would like me to be with them, but none of them are related to my job in the sense they can betray me or cause problems with work. though we are about to expand my work site to more floors. That's the only shake-up coming down the line though. So Hmmmmm. All very thought provoking. Thank you for that Sikla. *snugs*</div> </div> </div> </div>If it was a baby alligator, then it's a sign of something troubling coming ahead in your financial or work environment. An increase in size can also be symbolic of a little thing becoming a big thing, like a problem.<br /> <br /> Like I said, dream interpretation doesn't have any scientific basis, I'm just taking a shot at it for kicks and giggles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T20:10:48-07:00","id":129556,"title":"","content":"Sounds interesting to me. I wonder if I should do a tarot spread relating to my work. maybe there's some warning signs that I've been picking up on unconsciously that I should make myself aware of. The stories of Dreams shared in this thread are really facinating regardless of interpretation or not.<br /> <br /> Has anyone else had dreams where they are RPing or LARPing only to wake up and realize it didn't happen? I hate those. I'm always having such a good time and there's Plot and character development. Then you wake up and all those awesome advancements in the game are undone. Oh and there's always Dice getting lost at some point. Even if I was Rping online in a chat room.. So annoying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T20:13:44-07:00","id":129557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=129556#post129556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone else had dreams where they are RPing or LARPing only to wake up and realize it didn't happen? I hate those. I'm always having such a good time and there's Plot and character development. Then you wake up and all those awesome advancements in the game are undone. Oh and there's always Dice getting lost at some point. Even if I was Rping online in a chat room.. So annoying.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd be writing that down for future reference to see if it could work in my non-dream games.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-09T20:30:41-07:00","id":129566,"title":"","content":"I try but it's like... alternate reality/In-house rules/different time and setting than any current game I'm in. Stuff that might work in a future game if a bunch of other little things had been different in previous ones. Least with the characters I remember in the dream at the time... so weird. I've also been told occasionally one or two of my characters wind up visiting people I know in their dreams... I feel sorry for those people. My Euthanatos is a jerk.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-10T18:54:36-07:00","id":131167,"title":"","content":"Last night I had three distinct dreams.<br /> <br /> In the first dream, I was coming home from a friend's house which is on the other side of campus. Naturally, I was crossing campus to get home. It was cold and rainy and dark so I decided to cut through the buildings. (As a note, it has frequently been cold and rainy recently, and I often cut through the buildings when I come home across campus so this was normal.) The building was not the actual inside of any of the buildings on campus (and I have been in every building on campus). There was a group of people filming something for a class in the hallway. I veered around them and was trying to figure out where I was and what door to go out to be closest to my destination. At some point, I became aware that <i>something</i> was following me. It was quite terrifying. When I got &quot;home&quot; there was no way to get to my apartment, which was on the second floor. The way which I was trying to get up was by swinging on a tire swing trying to get onto a short roof and jump the banner onto the walkway outside my apartment. It was quite difficult and the <i>something</i> was getting closer.<br /> <br /> In a second dream, Obama came to my school to give some sort of speech. I was supposed to be getting on a bus to head somewhere, but I was running late. When I got to the bus, everyone was dead. I was captured by some federal agents, and I was locked up in my parents' house with Obama. He was evil and he had somehow released some EMP or some such to disable most people's cell phones. His still worked, but mine was disabled. Somehow I got hold of his cell phone, and tried to text my parents, but it still didn't work. So then I was trying to use my graphing calculator to send a text message.<br /> <br /> In the third dream, I was quite upset because I couldn't find my dinosaur keychain and I was convinced that my mom had put it somewhere. (I've never had a dinosaur keychain.) I was looking in my toybox from when I was little, and I think the dinosaurs in it were alive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":1041,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","user":"brjedi26","date":". 05-12-2014, 04:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T06:16:31-07:00","id":133629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=129556#post129556\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Has anyone else had dreams where they are RPing or LARPing only to wake up and realize it didn't happen? I hate those. I'm always having such a good time and there's Plot and character development. Then you wake up and all those awesome advancements in the game are undone. Oh and there's always Dice getting lost at some point. Even if I was Rping online in a chat room.. So annoying.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have done this a lot. The thing is, they tend to be some sort of WoD LARP. Before three kids we used to run a lot at con LARP's, played in a few ongoing ones, and you get the idea. But in the dreams the game is going on, people are looking good and spooky with their vamp face on, and suddenly shit gets real. Actual monsters of some sort start busting up on the game, and most people don't seem to realize it, they just think it's some really awesome props. Needless to say the games usually end with an extremely high death toll.<br /> <br /> Of late I've been having lots of ghost dreams. I blame my wife. Haunted cities, haunted streets, haunted cathedrals, haunted battlefields. It's like Ghostbusters after they shut off the containment unit, only it's inside my head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2546-jaellot","name":"jaellot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2546_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T16:00:44-07:00","id":135844,"title":"","content":"Woke up from a catnap. I dreamed I was the director of <b>X-Men: Days of Future Past</b>, and I was on set directing a scene involving Patrick Stewart and James McAvoy. They didn't like that I was calling them by their real names rather than the character names, and I was getting fed up, so I said, &quot;I could start calling you Young Charles and Old Charles, then.&quot;<br /> <br /> James McAvoy thought that was hilarious. Patrick Stewart said, &quot;Oh, look at this mouthy motherfucker over here!&quot;<br /> <br /> I wish to god I could hear Patrick Stewart actually say that in real life.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-13T16:53:59-07:00","id":135883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=135844#post135844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Woke up from a catnap. I dreamed I was the director of <b>X-Men: Days of Future Past</b>, and I was on set directing a scene involving Patrick Stewart and James McAvoy. They didn't like that I was calling them by their real names rather than the character names, and I was getting fed up, so I said, &quot;I could start calling you Young Charles and Old Charles, then.&quot;<br /> <br /> James McAvoy thought that was hilarious. Patrick Stewart said, &quot;Oh, look at this mouthy motherfucker over here!&quot;<br /> <br /> I wish to god I could hear Patrick Stewart actually say that in real life.</div> </div> </div> </div>Seriously, Jim, that's two great dreams you've posted about Marvel Characters in a row.<br /> <br /> YOU MUST TELL ME YOU SECRET","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T10:24:39-07:00","id":136858,"title":"","content":"Try dozing off in the living room while watching <b>American Dad!</b> as commercials for the new movie play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-14T17:39:14-07:00","id":137414,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=135844#post135844\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Woke up from a catnap. I dreamed I was the director of <b>X-Men: Days of Future Past</b>, and I was on set directing a scene involving Patrick Stewart and James McAvoy. They didn't like that I was calling them by their real names rather than the character names, and I was getting fed up, so I said, &quot;I could start calling you Young Charles and Old Charles, then.&quot;<br /> <br /> James McAvoy thought that was hilarious. Patrick Stewart said, &quot;Oh, look at this mouthy motherfucker over here!&quot;<br /> <br /> I wish to god I could hear Patrick Stewart actually say that in real life.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's so very awesome. I can totally see and hear that in my head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-17T07:33:47-07:00","id":140487,"title":"","content":"Last night, I dreamed that I was preparing to fight darkspawn (from Dragon Age). It was modern, as I had a compound bow (why then I wasn't using a rifle, I'm not sure). I was looking through and preparing some arrows, figuring out the purpose of various types of arrows. Some friends were already out fighting, and l but I had overheard the commander say that he and gods lieutenants were going to swing around the right flank and leave those who went to the left to die. This was where my friends were, and so I was very stressed about getting ready in time to save them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T12:41:19-07:00","id":143798,"title":"","content":"I dreamt I was in a bookstore in Spain. I have never been to Spain, so I don't know what bookstores are like there, but this one was incredibly classy - nice mahogany floors and bookshelves, Renaissance-era paintings on the walls, stuff like that.<br /> <br /> There was one oddity, though - when you went to check out, there was a dwarf standing beside the counter next to you. You were supposed to slap him in the face before carrying out your business, and if he was able to covertly slap you back while you paid for your books, you would be charged extra. Nobody else seemed to find this strange.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","name":"Cielle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-20T14:45:14-07:00","id":143888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cielle</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I dreamt I was in a bookstore in Spain. I have never been to Spain, so I don't know what bookstores are like there, but this one was incredibly classy - nice mahogany floors and bookshelves, Renaissance-era paintings on the walls, stuff like that. There was one oddity, though - when you went to check out, there was a dwarf standing beside the counter next to you. You were supposed to slap him in the face before carrying out your business, and if he was able to covertly slap you back while you paid for your books, you would be charged extra. Nobody else seemed to find this strange.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can (and do) comfirm, that's exactly how bookstores are here in Spain, down to the overcharging dwarf and all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-22T13:29:49-07:00","id":145977,"title":"","content":"I had a nightmare where the ghosts of Demonic children who were captured and experimented upon wanted to resurrect themselves using a child-like Promethean who was wandering around an abandoned warehouse. The ring of Demons investigating the issue chased the Promethean around and eventually found him assaulting a rent-a-cop in the parking lot before running away. The Demons ran to the security guy to check if he was still alive and put the mind-whammy on him to make him forget what he saw. Then the guy woke up and it turned out he was really a Hunter who did not take kindly to having his memories messed with. <br /> <br /> Then I woke up from excruciating kidney pain. This is not a good day for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T09:40:16-07:00","id":156607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Hanged Man</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Two-Face was all &quot;It's OK, I can drift with <i>myself</i>.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a great line.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-02T14:16:46-07:00","id":156895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Hanged Man</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Last night I was watching my &quot;The Big O&quot; DVDs[...]</div> </div> </div> </div>I've heard enough.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://1-media-cdn.foolz.us/ffuuka/board/tg/image/1380/07/1380076269285.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T07:54:24-07:00","id":157830,"title":"","content":"Last night, I had an amazingly awesome Sherlock Holmes dream that then turned really weird.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T08:41:11-07:00","id":157874,"title":"","content":"Well, it started out really awesome. I was Sherlock Holmes, and everybody thought it was the 1800's but there were some inconsistencies. I was smart and clever like Holmes always is. We were investigating a murder, trying to figure out whodunit. Turns out that it wasn't the 1800's, it was actually the 2000's and somehow people's memories had been erased and they had been made to believe that it was the 1800's.<br /> <br /> Then it turned out that he had been killed by aliens because he was an alien, and the aliens tried to kill me by bombing me, but I fled to a cave and made a circle out of pointy rocks which protected me from the bombs because magic and after they had stopped bombing, I smashed one of the rocks into a green powder, which, when I threw myself into it, I ended up on the TARDIS with which I went to some intergalactic council and argued that these aliens (who looked like Earth insects... no, not giant Earth insects, just Earth insects) were unrightfully invading Earth and the council agreed with me and forced the alien in charge of the invasion to resign and be replaced by someone else who looked like a tick.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T11:17:42-07:00","id":158055,"title":"","content":"They keep remaking movies, why doesn't someone film <i>that</i>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ortam + Malkavia makes a Requiem fun.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Posts in this colour are Persuasion.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">Posts in this colour are Seduction.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this colour are Intimidation.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/57-solomon-birch","name":"solomon birch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar57_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"289"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-03T12:34:52-07:00","id":158107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>solomon birch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=158055#post158055\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They keep remaking movies, why doesn't someone film <i>that</i>?</div> </div> </div> </div>Because <b>Cowboys &amp; Aliens</b> flopped.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T21:54:37-07:00","id":162204,"title":"","content":"A few nights ago, I had a dream where I was an alien on a flying saucer. However, it was like a video game. The visuals were a litter rounder than reality, and more cartoonish. And I was given missions. Things like abducting people. The mission which I remember best was as follows:<br /> Some other alien had directed a truck to run over an old lady. I was to stop the truck from running over the old lady. When I accomplished this, I was given the followup objective of pursuing the saucer which had been responsible for pointing the truck at her in the first place. It was benign and a relatively fun dream.<br /> <br /> Last night, I had a bad dream. I don't remember details of it. I remember flashes. I was in a room with a TV, and I was flipping through the channels. I think it was my bedroom, because there was a bed in there. My mom was in the next room over sitting at a table. I was emotionally distraught and I was filled to the point of bursting. I was trying to distract myself. (Something which has happened frequently this last week.) Later, the bed was flipped up and pushed up against the door, keeping it closed. I had my back against it and was slumped on the floor. I was weeping and pounding my fists against the floor in frustration of feeling powerless. It was rather real feeling and when I woke, I was not sure what was real and what was dream. It took me maybe upwards of 20 minutes to establish my grasp on reality. I'm putting off going to bed right now because I'm a little scared to. I have been having frequent unpleasant dreams.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-07T23:03:26-07:00","id":162234,"title":"","content":"I don't really remember my dreams. At most I recall a scene or situation or two, but if you ask me about it half an hour after I'm fully awake, I'll have forgotten it (<span style=\"font-size:10px\">Though, like everyone else, my memories lie to me and most likely contain fragments of lies I told as a kid and now remember as truth, memories my brain &quot;invented&quot; when someone told me of an event in which they thought I was present but wasn't, different situations conflated into a single jumbled one and so on. So it quite possible that some stuff I &quot;remember&quot; happened in dreams only.</span>).<br /> <br /> There have been only two times that I managed to recall relatively clearly <span style=\"font-size:10px\">(as far as I can tell, anyway)</span> a scene from a dream. One was a pretty typical nightmare, I guess: killer moving at unnatural speed while I moved very slow and can't stop him, I wake up when his blade reaches my mother's neck. That is not the one I want to talk about, though. There was this time that I found a scene amusing enough that I recalled it after waking up. It was a corridor with a safe on the floor at the end of it, and behind it were metal bars like in prison cell. I found it weird/amusing because hey, why are the bars not <i>in front</i> of the safe? (I bet I must have dreamed much stranger stuff over my life, but this was the one that stuck with me).<br /> <br /> Months later, I and other people in my College (I graduated in physical education) were working in an sporting event and there on our place of lodging I saw a familiar scene, a corridor, which had half-walls that continued as only iron bars up to the ceiling, with a completely out of place safe at the end, which brought back the memory of that dream.<br /> <br /> This was years ago, but to this day I sometimes half-jokingly wonder if seeing that just made me recall a <b>very vaguely</b> similar dream, with my brain filling the blanks and making it seem like the same scene, or if I should be trying to dream about lottery numbers or something.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T03:39:35-07:00","id":165777,"title":"","content":"<b>Well, strange. 8 pages of dreams, and nobody talking about lucid dreams?</b> <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> Anyways, my dream:<br /> Some days ago I dreamed to be inside an Awakening game. I discussed with some people and with the ghost of an old person in wheelchair. Actually, the ghost was quite physical. Anyway, I got to further explore the death of this ghost, and I happened to encounter some strange magic circles in a large corridor. Some naked bodies where there. They were a little antropomorphic, but they were slowly turning back to their human state.<br /> Me: &quot;Geez, so anyone who did this was reviving these people to turn them into antropomorph creatures?&quot;<br /> Fellow mage: &quot;Yep. That seems quite like it.&quot;<br /> Me: &quot;Any thaumaturge, vampire or mage could re-activate those circles. You think I should destroy the circles?&quot;<br /> Fellow mage: &quot;Yes, definitely!&quot;<br /> But then, a rival cabal came into the corridor asking what we were doing here.<br /> I quickly took my fellow mage's arm, and thought &quot;I have to turn into a Twilight state!&quot; so I used Death to turn us into Twilight and eventually run away through a wall.<br /> Then I woke up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T08:15:44-07:00","id":165930,"title":"","content":"Well, what do you mean by lucid dreaming? Wikipedia defines a lucid dream as &quot;any dream in which one is aware that one is dreaming.&quot; If that's what you mean, then that happens to me frequently. Frequently enough that it's not even worth mentioning it's so unnoteworthy. If you go the extra step and mean a dream where I know that I'm dreaming and therefore can make decisions and make god-like changes on the world (which is what I thought a lucid dream was until about a week ago), then no, that's never happened to me. <br /> <br /> Last night my dream was strange. I was moving, or something, and had a pile of stuff outside on the lawn including my razor scooter. (I've never owned a razor scooter.) Later, some friends of mine, who used to live here but have moved, showed up unexpectedly. The wife had gotten a body modification and had had grafted into her skin at her neck, waist and ankles some kind of African bead necklace. They also brought along three kittens whom I tried to get my cat to play with. (I don't own a cat.) My cat, however, was very typically catlike and treated the kittens with utter disdain, as if she didn't even notice their presence. My friends had also brought with them, for some reason, a former roommate of mine, whom I kind of hate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T09:00:06-07:00","id":171679,"title":"","content":"Last night, I had a dream.<br /> <br /> I was Samuel L. Jackson starrring in a low budget action flick. It felt like a cross between The Long Kiss Goodnight and Shaft. I/he/the character was on some sort of vigilante killing spree, and at one point I rested in someone's apartment after killing him. Then I noticed that there were two women in the apartment and they recognized me. Once, I had been a stage actor, with the lead role in a production of the Count of Monte Cristo, but the producers kept coming up with more and more elaborate ways to not show any of the killing in that play, and the audience began to disconnect. With my acting career ruined, I turned to a life of showing people how brutal killing really was.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-17T09:43:52-07:00","id":171704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=165930#post165930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, what do you mean by lucid dreaming? Wikipedia defines a lucid dream as &quot;any dream in which one is aware that one is dreaming.&quot; If that's what you mean, then that happens to me frequently. Frequently enough that it's not even worth mentioning it's so unnoteworthy. If you go the extra step and mean a dream where <b>I know that I'm dreaming and therefore can make decisions and make god-like changes on the world</b> (which is what I thought a lucid dream was until about a week ago), then no, that's never happened to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Being aware makes you lucid. The fact that you didn't change your dreamscape doesn't mean you weren't lucid, but changing the dream is easy once you know you are dreaming. I happened to do some cool tricks like flying, using telekinesis, teleporting, getting my right finger through my left palm...<br /> Plus, lucid dreaming can be useful for a variety of things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/316-jesuncolo","name":"Jesuncolo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar316_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T06:13:43-07:00","id":206960,"title":"","content":"I don't remember the dream itself. I just know I was in a D&amp;D-type world, tricking giants into locking themselves in prison cells, and that I asked my employer why they had to be in separate cages. He responded, &quot;What, do you want to see a bunch of male giants tying their dicks together?&quot;<br /> <br /> Then I woke up. I assume I had had enough of that weirdness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T08:05:44-07:00","id":207078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=206960#post206960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> &quot;What, do you want to see a bunch of male giants tying their dicks together?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Hell. Yes.<br /> <br /> Giants tying their dicks together inexplicably sounds, at the very least, like a learning experience. Seriously, when would you ever be able to see that outside of your imagination?!?? I just hope they both, as if in unspoken harmony start spinning around together, like when you were small and an adult would hold your hands/wrists while I they swung you around like an Olympic hammer thrower that got tired before the moment you're supposed to let go.<br /> <br /> In my head, this is how hurricanes are really born now. Jim has forced me to abandon science altogether and blame all in inclement weather on giants who can't stop being creative with their own dicks.<br /> <br /> I dreamt that the cops were taping off my neighbor's house with yellow crime scene tape. Turns out it wasn't a dream. Someone was stabbed to death.<br /> Welcome to the projects. I've been awake for less than 12 minutes, as of right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T09:35:55-07:00","id":207240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=206960#post206960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't remember the dream itself. I just know I was in a D&amp;D-type world, tricking giants into locking themselves in prison cells, and that I asked my employer why they had to be in separate cages. He responded, &quot;What, do you want to see a bunch of male giants tying their dicks together?&quot;<br /> <br /> Then I woke up. I assume I had had enough of that weirdness.</div> </div> </div> </div>No more anchovy pizza before bed for you, young man.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T10:09:57-07:00","id":207285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=207240#post207240\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No more anchovy pizza before bed for you, young man.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sausage pizza, actually. I have a mild addiction to Little Caesar's sausage pizza.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-24T10:13:27-07:00","id":207288,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=207285#post207285\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sausage pizza, actually. I have a mild addiction to <b>Little Caesar's </b>sausage pizza.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's your problem.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T16:41:56-07:00","id":223708,"title":"","content":"This thread ain't dead yet!<br /> <br /> So I had two dreams last eve, the first being that I went to a concert featuring... some rock band, either Rush or Journey, maybe Styx (perhaps all three!). They had this whole little village thing set up where you could buy cool stuff like t-shirts and candy, and I remember buying a few things (just a few). Anyway, concert rocked, I was really happy... and then I got the bill for the whole shebang, which was $74,256.36. Cue total panic as I realized it would take me YEARS on my current income to pay it off, and then I woke up. A short time later I went back to sleep and...<br /> <br /> I was playing the part of a man who had been abducted by aliens. They had wiped his memory of earth, and stuck him in an extremely convincing false reality of ease and luxury (for some reason, they never told me why the $(#*!)*#). However, no matter how immersed he was in the fantasy, there would always be something that triggered his memories and he would try to escape the gilded cage. They would catch him, wipe his mind again, and the cycle would repeat. I had gotten to the part where the memory erasing procedure no longer worked on him, when I woke up again.<br /> <br /> So, yeah. That was interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-09T18:43:51-07:00","id":223751,"title":"","content":"That second dream sounds awesome. <br /> <br /> Of course this thread isn't dead yet. I will post in this thread when I have something to say. I frequently have vivid dreams. I have had (more than several, fewer than many) dreams that I have not posted recently because... I haven't felt like it? I guess. Sometimes they're just not really worth sharing (&quot;I had a sex dream. It was with a girl that I know but none of you have ever met. There was... sex.&quot;) or sometimes they're very complicated and trying to organize them into some sort of coherency is daunting enough that I don't try. But... I like sharing my dreams. I like it when people comment on them.<br /> <br /> So, yeah. Please continue to share if you have anything interesting!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T08:30:18-07:00","id":225992,"title":"","content":"I dreamed last night that my friend who has been studying abroad in Jerusalem had come home. This isn't particularly weird, as she comes home this week.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">I also dreamed last night that my friend Aaron lived in the house across the street from my parents. He and I were making cake bites or doughnut holes or something; something round and baked. Later, my dad accused him of practicing witchcraft. I was infuriated by this accusation and went about destroying stuff: smashing dishes, keying the car and so forth. It was quite a stressful dream.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-12T08:53:07-07:00","id":226003,"title":"","content":"Dreamt I was in a post-apocalyptic warzone, fighting bio-mechanical war machines, kinda like Vozhd from VtM altered by psychotic MTAs Etherites, and all I had on me was my Ka-bar standard issue 7 inch and some busted-ass Mad Max body armor. I was sure I was screwed. The drone-bots (spider-like mechanical things that spot targets for the hover-drakes, with human-ish skin and razored pincers) were starting to triangulate my position and I KNEW that I was screwed. Absolutely screwed. I had unsheathed my knife and was preparing, with beads of sweat on my brow that I swear I could really feel, for my last stand.<br /> <br /> Just then, an amazingly beautiful woman with absolutely badass batlike wings descended from above, sword in hand. She looked back at me and told me, with a smile on her face, &quot;The war isn't over until it's over. We'll fight together.&quot;<br /> The rest of the dream is blurry, but I'm pretty sure there was a steamy bit near the end.<br /> All in all, one of my best dreams ever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-12-2014, 11:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T03:56:14-07:00","id":228971,"title":"","content":"I had a stupid nightmare last night, I still cant verbally speak of it cause it freaked me out. (it may not seem scary to others without context but the context is VERY personal)<br /> <br /> I want to put it somewhere it can be seen because its driving me mad<br /> <br /> I was walking out of my house at night, the asphalt parking lot in front of my apartments was covered in white salt, that as i walked was slick as ice so I was forced to walk carefully. I vaugly could feel a presence watching me, walking just behind me not making sound. I found myself unwilling to turn around and look and see who it was. I felt like i wasnt supposed to look. I kept walking approching the small creekish place near my apartments, except in this dream it was a river maybe 10 feet wide and was quite shallow looking, with a steep embankment and deep black water.<br /> <br /> Up untill this point i could see just fine the light of hte streetlights had aided in that but as i found myself almost unwillingly walking towards the edge of the embankment away from the safety of the lights it grew dark ,i could hardly see. I walked carefully not wanting to slip on the slick salt, i kept my head down watching my feet to be sure i didnt fall. I forwhatever reason felt compelled to look up, across to the other shore, standing in the shadows but still clearly seen,I see a figure cloaked in black shirtless in this cold night, clawed feet digging into the salt, with white skin, his dark feathered black wings folded against his back. I know him..I Know him well. My guide. my friend...I havent seen him in my dreams in so long. I wanted to go to him, i wanted, no needed to talk to him needed his guidance once again. Without thinking i took a step, and in an instant lost my foot slipping down the embankment, i wasnt worried after all the water wasnt that deep. Or so I thought.<br /> <br /> I hit the stark black water excepting to end up on my ass in the water. Instead for a moment my head slipped under the water. i flailed to break the surface so I could breath, desperatly i tried to find my footing but no mater what i did my feet would not touch the ground the water was so deep. I felt like I couldnt move, I couldnt get to the shore again even though it was close on either side. It took all I had to stay above. I screamed for help, begging him to help me, to not leave me to the water that I was scared. I looked up panicked when he didnt respond, his wings shadowed the moon as he looked down on me from the enbankment not moving. I saw a simple look of sorrow on his beautiful face as he turned his back, leaving me alone. i heard a crow caw in the distance just before i went under for the last time.<br /> ___________________<br /> <br /> I woke up screaming. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> To me this dream is significant. Is he leaving? will he come back to me...why did he abandon me to drown...what is he trying to tell me...I dont understand <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> He is never straight forward with his messages, but oh gods i have NEVER had him do this to me...Usually he'll speak but no...this time he said nothing and left me alone why? Why the nightmare....<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-16T11:01:16-07:00","id":230332,"title":"","content":"I dreamt last night that the player characters in the new pbp i'm co-running got pissed at me because of some delays. The characters. Not the players, but their characters. <br /> <br /> Yay stress.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"http://stranger-things.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Stranger Things</a> .... have happened</b><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">A nwod/GMC compatable pbp RP</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3705-jespernoir","name":"Jespernoir","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T08:43:35-07:00","id":242271,"title":"","content":"Remember how there used to be those actual physical store locations where you'd go to rent movies? Yeah, me neither. :-P But a couple days ago, I dreamed that I was in one of those places looking for an Xbox game. They were constantly rearranging while I was looking, making it impossible to find.<br /> <br /> Last night I dreamed that I was in an apartment where the kitchen sink was installed backwards, so that the faucet and handles were on the side facing you. I was thoroughly irritated by it, but the guy who lived there was like, &quot;It's just what we've got to live with.&quot; Then a pretty girl showed up and he flirted with her.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T11:51:51-07:00","id":242366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=242271#post242271\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Remember how there used to be those actual physical store locations where you'd go to rent movies?</div> </div> </div> </div>Every time I drive past the mattress shop where Venture Video once stood.<br /> <br /> sigh<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"