urable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T07:44:14-07:00","id":243924,"title":"","content":"I had a dream that the Chronicles of Narnia were part of Stargate SG-1's backstory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T08:51:30-07:00","id":244018,"title":"","content":"Aslan is an alien, huh?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-29T10:45:59-07:00","id":244172,"title":"","content":"This one I had last night makes me think I should have been a writer or something.<br /> <br /> A young man in college meets the most gorgeous and compelling woman he's ever seen, and follows her into her social club to win her affections. This group seems to be some kind of mixing circle/ study group/ dating service, at least as much as the young man can tell. The people seem a bit eccentric, but our hero isn't exactly normal either, so he rolls with it.<br /> Everything seems to be going fine, until...<br /> <br /> Things take a turn for the weird. These people seem rather superstitious, each having separate beliefs that the protagonist has never encountered before. They talk about strange things, such as long discredited scientific theories spoken as fact, and unusual interpretations of historical events with a decidedly... supernatural bent. Occasionally, they'll even reference things that happened in the young man's life that they could not possibly have known about.<br /> <br /> Other odd people flit in and out of the drama: a short, haggard old black man that the young man last saw at a loved one's funeral delivers cryptic warnings. A distinguished gentleman with gray hair and a short, well-trimmed beard is seen talking to the beautiful woman. He turns to look at the young man, smiles and walks away...<br /> <br /> Wait... there! Just for a moment, when the gentleman was smiling! The young man saw something, on the gentleman's temples. It looked like... no, it couldn't have been. But was it...<br /> <br /> Could he have truly seen... HORNS?!<br /> <br /> <br /> ... So yeah, that was pretty interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":175,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","user":"Prometheus878","date":". 08-29-2014, 04:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T05:48:46-07:00","id":272167,"title":"","content":"Last night, I had a dream that was really frustrating. I was watching a movie, and it was based on a book. But it started earlier than the book did. And for some asinine reason, it ended right when the book began. So basically, someone had made a movie prequel to a book. And I had this jingle play in my head &quot;<i>When the book begins</i>&quot; and the jingle was so damn happy sounding.<br /> <br /> Also, Prometheus, that sounds awesome. I tried to post that when you first posted, but my computer was freaking out and not letting me post that day. And then I kind of forgot. :/ Sorry.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T10:54:11-07:00","id":272352,"title":"","content":"S'okay, I know that feel bro brosef broski brodude dudebro slowbro.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T08:50:27-07:00","id":273896,"title":"","content":"I had a dream where I was Dr. Watson to Benedict Cumberbatch's Sherlock Holmes, though the time setting was wibbly wobbly. We were investigating a death in a mental institution and discussing the moral quandaries of mental health incarceration. The mental institution was in some dingy waterlogged underground area under a regular hospital and when we had people stand in the machine where things had gone wrong, one of the investigators with us became trapped in a tube that was filling with water. So I pulled out my pistol to try and break the glass, and Holmes and I ended up in some capsule that sank the bottom of the Thames and the interior surface shattered into tiny sci-fi data crystal things that would have to be reassembled in the correct positions before we ran out of oxygen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T07:31:15-07:00","id":274713,"title":"","content":"Tonight's dream was a 70s Detective Drama with the Russian Mob having infiltrated the local FBI branch office. It features James Garner as a hit man and George Takei as a reporter for Playboy who had stumbled across the plot with a FOIA request. He was wearing a sky blue vinyl coat with white rabbit fur lining, a matching fedora, smoking via a cigarette holder.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T09:17:43-07:00","id":274774,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">I was going to school and it was a cross between high school and here (BYU-Idaho). I decided, I don't know why, to cross dress. I got fake boobs and wore a bra with a button up shirt. There were lots of parents around and lots of kids taking tests; it was graduation week or something. I went into the bathroom (which was a dual sex bathroom) and went into s stall to pee. I peed standing up because I was still a dude, just with fake breasts. On my way out I ran into someone I knew and they kind of freaked out.<br /> <br /> Anyway, as I was wandering around, I got a lot more attention than I normally do but it was kind of inappropriate attention. I couldn't remember what class I was supposed to go to so I sat down and pulled out my phone to check. I saw someone else I knew and said hi. We chatted and I gave him a hug. He slid his hand down and squeezed my ass. I was kind of pissed. I went back to finding out what class I was supposed to go to and my alarm on my phone started to go off. It was a meditation bell sounding thing.<br /> <br /> I got up to go to my class, and <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/M._Russell_Ballard\" target=\"_blank\">Elder Ballard</a> came up to me as I was walking toward my class (and commented on the ringtone to which I kind of mumbled a reply) and said something about how women are treated inappropriately. Then he grabbed my phone and tried to take it away, implying that I obviously couldn't afford it (because I was a woman) and therefore must have stolen it. Then an old friend came up and I tried to get him to tell Elder Ballard that it was my phone and he started to say maybe Elder Ballard was right because I was always concerned about money. Then I woke up.</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-07T10:12:46-07:00","id":274817,"title":"","content":"etherial: Your dreams are <i>awesome</i>.<br /> <br /> brjedi26: ... Well, at least it was entertaining.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T05:16:21-07:00","id":289451,"title":"","content":"I dreamed I had traveled to Loxosceles's house for reasons the dream wasn't clear on. I don't think he knew I was coming, either. I knocked and no one answered, so I just let myself in and climbed the stairs to his room, where he was asleep. I stood over him, staring down at him for a few minutes, and then--again, for reasons the dream didn't offer--stole a long, plastic tube he was holding in his left hand. It was a tube used for blowing soap bubbles, though why he went to sleep with it in hand was beyond me.<br /> <br /> When I went to the stairs to leave, two armrails had popped up in the middle of the stairway, narrowing the available walking area until I had to turn sideways, suck in my gut, and inch down the stairs to get to the door. It wasn't a quiet process; I was shaking the armrails as I went down, and I think that noise is what woke Loxosceles up a few steps from the bottom. I hurried as fast as I could to the door and let myself out, telling myself he would think all the noise I was making was part of a dream he was having.<br /> <br /> Out on the street, I was walking back to my car, strolling really, when I heard Lox's roar of rage at the discovery that his home had been invaded and his three-foot soap bubble tube had been stolen. I was only a few steps from the car, but that roar panicked me: I thought he might get downstairs and see me driving off, and I couldn't let him see my identity, so I ran down the road a couple of hundred feet to the house two doors down and turned let to duck behind its far side. It was painfully slow (though I suspect that was the slowness of me being old and fat rather than the slowness of trying to outrun a pursuer in a dream), and by the time I found my hiding place I was exhausted, using my arms to drag myself forward. I leaned against the house's wall for support and dared a look around the corner to see what was happening. Loxosceles and his roommate, an immense wall of a human being whom I had not known was there, were out in the street by his house and my car, hunting for the thief and coming in my direction. Lox had an iron rod in his hand for punitive beating.<br /> <br /> I was too weak and shaky to run any more, so I walked shakily along the side of the wall away from them, trying to circle around the house in the hopes I'd be able to sneak back to my car when they passed by. It was then I realized that I couldn't see them any more, and they might have cut through the yard between his house and the house I was hiding in and they might see me when I turned the corner so I should stay where I was but if they didn't turn then they'd see me when they passed this house on the street and I was paralyzed by fear and couldn't move or think or make a plan and just waited there for him to discover my betrayal--why had I even done it?--and to beat me and then I woke up.<br /> <br /> My heart was pounding in my chest hard enough to scare me, though that might have been residual fear from the nightmare. It was painless, but I'd convinced myself I was only a few steps away from a heart attack, and tried desperately to calm myself down as I lay there with sweat dripping from my hair into my pillow. A glance at the clock told me I'd been asleep for an hour.<br /> <br /> Now I'm awake again, for the third time today, if you're counting. I feel like it's going to be a bad day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T06:45:38-07:00","id":289502,"title":"","content":"You want my interpretation on that one or did you figure it out yourself?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T13:08:30-07:00","id":289914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=289502#post289502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You want my interpretation on that one or did you figure it out yourself?</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh. I have a guess of my own, but that doesn't mean I don't enjoy outside perspectives. Let's hear it.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-22T13:40:46-07:00","id":289949,"title":"","content":"The bubble tube is your happiness. It's taking that form because back when you were content to play with bubbles is a time when you felt very happy and content. You feel as if their rejection of you has stolen your happiness from you, and you really REALLY want to take it back. However, your failure to escape shows that you don't feel as if you deserve to take it back, to be happy.<br /> <br /> And you're wrong, you do deserve it.<br /> <br /> So quit being so down on yourself or I'm gonna have to open a home for all the depressed folks I have on here just so I can keep an eye on you all.<br /> <br /> Don't make me come over there!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-24T17:36:21-07:00","id":291658,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry Jim.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For these reasons, the trade of a soldier is held the most honourable of all others; because a soldier is a Yahoo hired to kill, in cold blood, as many of his own species, who have never offended him, as possibly he can.&quot; \u2015 from &quot;Gulliver's Travels&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1041-brjedi26","name":"brjedi26","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1041_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"495"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-25T07:23:00-07:00","id":292009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=289949#post289949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The bubble tube is your happiness. It's taking that form because back when you were content to play with bubbles is a time when you felt very happy and content. You feel as if their rejection of you has stolen your happiness from you, and you really REALLY want to take it back. However, your failure to escape shows that you don't feel as if you deserve to take it back, to be happy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I thought it was just a mishmash of my usual obsessions: the guilt I feel at all the little, senseless evils I commit in a day; my shame at having failed them as a friend with my selfishness; my persistent sense of impotence.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>brjedi26</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=291658#post291658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm sorry Jim.</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh. I appreciate the sympathy, but it's just a dream.<br /> <br /> ...Or, well, two dreams. I had another.<br /> <br /> I was at an overnight party hosted by a well-to-do friend; the dream did not tell me who this friend was or why he was throwing such a party, but I had an impression it was an after-wedding party. Loxofish was there, and if I may break the narrative of the dream for a moment to comment on its contents, I must say I'm surprised that Loxosceles was there in the first dream but Devilfish wasn't, because &quot;Loxofish&quot; is not just a portmanteau for me. The two of them really are kind of a single unit in my head, and when I think of one I almost always think of the other. I don't know what separated them in the previous dream.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I was in a big living room type of area, sitting on the floor and playing cards when Loxosceles came over. We sat there awkwardly for a moment, and then he thanked me for a gift I'd given him when the party started (apparently I bought gifts for everyone at the start of the party), a rare Magic: the Gathering card.* &quot;I was out at a garage sale and I saw it and I wanted you to have it,&quot; I lied, not knowing even then why I was lying about getting it in a pack of cards I bought for myself, but he seemed to buy it, and for a moment we were comfortably quiet before he had to get up and go to the kitchen. I looked up and saw Devilfish over there; our eyes met, and she looked instantly away and stepped closer to Loxosceles so she could put her arm around him for the comfort it would afford her. I got up and went to the bathroom without a word, and though I'd like to say it was for noble reasons of trying to make her more comfortable, I don't know why I did it. The dream provided no emotional context for the scene.<br /> <br /> In the bathroom, I saw the toilet was full of pee. I flushed it, and it began to overflow almost immediately; I climbed up on the edge of the tub while looking around for a plunger, but didn't see one. I guessed our hosts had hidden it so it wouldn't remind their guests of the crudeness of human biology. I got out of the bathroom door without getting my feet wet (no idea how; it was a dream transition) and went to look for the host to tell him about the situation in the bathroom, but he was showing off his collection of ultra-rare, even mythical RPG supplements, like the crossover between Forgotten Realms and Star Wars, or the AD&amp;D supplement that taught DMs how to incorporate starships and lasers into a fantasy setting.<br /> <br /> Then, with the dream thoroughly off the rails of the connection I am now trying to draw after the fact, I woke up.<br /> <br /> <br /> *Further out-of-dream commenting: This is not a gift I would have ever bought him, because he would not thank me for it. Dreams; what can you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-26T20:42:38-07:00","id":293373,"title":"","content":"Wanna stretch out on my couch for that one, too?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T04:57:51-07:00","id":293632,"title":"","content":"Go ahead. I feel like by posting this stuff on a public discussion forum, I've invited anyone to comment who wants to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T06:51:59-07:00","id":293700,"title":"","content":"You feel like you offered Loxofish something valuable (your friendship) but even you considered it less than worthy (a MtG card they wouldn't want in the first place and that you &quot;just found in a pack for yourself). You think they pretended to appreciate it, but they didn't really and you figured they wouldn't in the first place (hence, the card not having any value to them or you). You think 'Fish might have been the instigator, believing that you wanted her more for yourself then as just a friend. You felt as if you didn't belong at the party and that your contributions to that social situation would be ejected and that no one would care for anything you have to say (the whole bathroom incident).<br /> <br /> Now, I don't know what the deal with Loxofish could be, but again, <i><b>YOU ARE NOT WORTHLESS</b></i> and I will continue to verbally beat you about the head and neck with that fact until it starts to get thru. Capisce? Verstshen? Comprendre? Entender? Ponyat? Parstyyn? How many more ways do I have to use?<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:9px\">((in case any one is wondering, that's Italian, German, French, Spanish, Russian and Yiddish))</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":375,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","user":"Papa Bear","date":". 10-27-2014, 10:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T14:06:13-07:00","id":294143,"title":"","content":"You're sweet, Papa Bear, but my personal take on that dream is rather more dismissive. I dreamed about them because they're on my mind; I dreamed about them being uncomfortable around me because that too was on my mind; I dreamed about a Magic card because Loxosceles was very big into them at one time; I dreamed about a bathroom overflowing because the bathrooms in Devilfish's house confused me while I was there (why did the toilets have so many buttons? I never did figure out what they all do), and it's something I think about most of the time when I think about her.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T14:09:54-07:00","id":294145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=294143#post294143\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You're sweet, Papa Bear, but my personal take on that dream is rather more dismissive. I dreamed about them because they're on my mind; I dreamed about them being uncomfortable around me because that too was on my mind; I dreamed about a Magic card because Loxosceles was very big into them at one time; I dreamed about a bathroom overflowing because the bathrooms in Devilfish's house confused me while I was there (why did the toilets have so many buttons? I never did figure out what they all do), and it's something I think about most of the time when I think about her.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe that &quot;sometimes a cigar is just a cigar&quot; answer is right and maybe it's not.<br /> <br /> I read a lot of subtext into things, even when they're not there, and sometime they are there. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T15:06:41-07:00","id":294181,"title":"","content":"Well I certainly don't know where you could have possibly gotten the idea that I have low self-esteem, heh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-27T15:19:54-07:00","id":294188,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div cla