screening of a new Marvel movie. We were at War in Europe. A trainload of marines was on its way East and the CO gave an impassioned speech before stepping off the train. As the train continued down the track, it got pulled into a gravity well generator controlled by The Red Skull and, like steak into a meat grinder, the train was crushed and melted before being incorporated into the airship he was building (BTW, one of these sequences was done using 80s-level cgi because the movie in my dream was still mid-development and the imaginary sfx team hadn't finished the shot yet). Then the skull-shaped airship takes off and flies menacingly at the camera, at which point I wake up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T12:51:31-08:00","id":308462,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=308196#post308196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had a dream this morning that I was watching a preview screening of a new Marvel movie. We were at War in Europe. A trainload of marines was on its way East and the CO gave an impassioned speech before stepping off the train. As the train continued down the track, it got pulled into a gravity well generator controlled by The Red Skull and, like steak into a meat grinder, the train was crushed and melted before being incorporated into the airship he was building (BTW, one of these sequences was done using 80s-level cgi because the movie in my dream was still mid-development and the imaginary sfx team hadn't finished the shot yet). Then the skull-shaped airship takes off and flies menacingly at the camera, at which point I wake up.</div> </div> </div> </div>More often then not, our dreams leave us with little more than confusion. Sometimes, they leave us in fear.<br /> <br /> But sometimes, they give back, and we wish we could go back to sleep to see what else they have to show us.<br /> <br /> I honestly don't know how you were able to pull yourself out of bed, etherial.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T10:44:31-08:00","id":309311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=308462#post308462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I honestly don't know how you were able to pull yourself out of bed, etherial.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm married to a wonderful person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-13T06:24:21-08:00","id":311151,"title":"","content":"Still no new Science on why we dream, but new evidence leads us to believe that your body hoses your brain down to clean out the gunk while you sleep.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.sciencemag.org/content/342/6156/373\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.sciencemag.org/content/342/6156/373</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-14T09:30:28-08:00","id":312321,"title":"","content":"So. Last night one of my dreams was of a fictional President of the United States dressing up as a blue-haired elf in a Japanese pageant, swinging a plastic daiklave around, and hamming it up like there was no tomorrow.<br /> <br /> I could give you the context, but... I think I won't. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T07:21:42-08:00","id":318931,"title":"","content":"In the waking world, I think Taylor Swift is pretty. That's about the end of my impression of her physical appearance; she's nice to look at, but for whatever reason there's no sexual component to this opinion. Like, I've never had a fantasy about, nor a desire to, do sexual stuff with her. I don't know why that is, but I also don't care. Wondering why I don't want to bang a pop star young enough to be my daughter (if I'd been sexually active immediately following puberty, anyway) isn't a thought that keeps me up at nights.<br /> <br /> This morning, I woke up from a dream in which I was both Taylor Swift and the photographer doing a shoot with her. Taylor was in the exercise equivalent of a bra and panties, feeling increasingly ashamed of herself as she posed her way through a series of increasingly seductive yet weirdly submissive photos. The photographer sensed her discomfort but didn't care, and kept demanding she keep doing it, telling her that this was the way to get the fame she wants, though that was a lie. He just wanted a nubile young woman to be mostly naked in front of him so he could take pleasure in looking at how sleek her skin was and how he could masturbate to those photos when they were developed.<br /> <br /> Now, I remind that in this dream I was the both of them, so it was really conflicted and confusing to be ashamed of the way I was objectifying myself for my own future masturbation prospects, and even in the dream I recognized that. It didn't help that half of me was planning to masturbate to myself, or that I woke up with a case of morning wood so bad I had to coax it down before I could even pee.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T09:37:53-08:00","id":319007,"title":"","content":"You are always everyone in your dreams, Jim.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T20:45:44-08:00","id":319584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=319007#post319007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You are always everyone in your dreams, Jim.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is a recurring theme with me, but not always.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T02:46:12-08:00","id":319764,"title":"","content":"I have a strange recurring nightmare. Just before waking I hear,<br /> <br /> &quot;You are dead.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's actually kind of terrifying. It's a disembodied voice, but one that doesn't feel like my own. There is no other context for the voice. It's like a voice from the other side has just informed me of my sudden demise.<br /> <br /> Funny thing is, I consider myself an atheist, so I don't expect there will be a voice when it happens. But even still, even after having this dream a hundred times, I still believe the voice, and I still sit straight up in bed with my heart going a mile a minute, and it still takes me a moment to figure out that no, I am not dead, this is not some bizarre afterlife, I just had that weird dream again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1078-froggy711","name":"Froggy711","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1078_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T04:55:31-08:00","id":319805,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=319584#post319584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is a recurring theme with me, but not always.</div> </div> </div> </div>You misunderstand, I think.<br /> <br /> Explain, I will.<br /> <br /> Until someone can prove that the Changelings are actually real and coming into our dreams, there isn't anybody in there but you. You can have impressions of someone else, reflections of how you feel about them and what you think about them, but they're still not that other person. It's still just you in your own head. Dreams are always about yourself. How you feel about something, how you didn't like something, how someone else seems to you. Dreams are the internal myths of everyone's psyche.<br /> <br /> So, no matter the perspective of the dream, you're always everybody in your dreams.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T09:56:15-08:00","id":319999,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=319805#post319805\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So, no matter the perspective of the dream, you're always everybody in your dreams.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thanks for ruining every sexual dream I've ever had, and making the awkward ones almost mind-shattering. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Sanity is for squares.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-23T14:51:01-08:00","id":320203,"title":"","content":"Sanity is for those who can't handle the inherent madness of the universe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-02T08:50:14-08:00","id":328263,"title":"","content":"My dreamscape tonignt ended in several ads for the Johnson School of Dance in Portland, OR. One of them mentioned an award they received from the Marketing Association of America for creating the inexplicable string of dance competition movies that are the primary inspiration of their students and primary career aspiration. The last one featured an 8-foot tall green frog demon giving the school the Sith Academy Medal for Service for their endless supply of acrobatic assasins.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-10T20:34:32-08:00","id":336677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=308462#post308462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> More often then not, our dreams leave us with little more than confusion. Sometimes, they leave us in fear.<br /> <br /> But sometimes, they give back, and we wish we could go back to sleep to see what else they have to show us.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WuRkHfW8MaQ\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WuRkHfW8MaQ\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WuRkHfW8MaQ\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WuRkHfW8MaQ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-24T08:51:21-08:00","id":349066,"title":"","content":"A brief snippet of last night's dream: The city of Duckburg (or maybe <span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Cape Suzette) is under attack by Cobra, so they Transform the city into Robot Mode.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-29T09:00:58-08:00","id":353772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/28651-dreams?p=349066#post349066\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A brief snippet of last night's dream: The city of Duckburg (or maybe <span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Cape Suzette) is under attack by Cobra, so they Transform the city into Robot Mode.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>That one is easy to interpret.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">You've been watching too many 1980's cartoons.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T04:38:57-08:00","id":380906,"title":"","content":"So the dream I had on Friday night was a weird one.<br /> <br /> In my dream I was working as the manager of a department store or supermarket and my employees were really weird. I forget the specifics but the weirdest was an old lady who\u2019d just walk up to people and ask if they\u2019d considered suicide like it was a lifestyle choice or something, I think that she had pamphlets about it.<br /> Anyway people were excited because for some reason David Tennant was there and we were excited about that until he tried a free sample of food and died.<br /> <br /> At which point someone from regional management became involved and they were incredibly callous about the whole ordeal - someone was in a panic saying &quot;oh my god we killed Doctor Who&quot; and he calmly corrected her that it wasn\u2019t the current Doctor Who. As well as saying that they couldn\u2019t resign over this because that would be admitting full responsibility for Tennant\u2019s death and that if anyone did they\u2019d be charged with his murder. So at that point we turned on each other, particularly the creepy old lady who we thought might have \u201cconvinced him to let go\u201d.<br /> <br /> Once the infighting was over, I start talking to someone who is obviously the most normal person there , she\u2019s as horrified by all these goings on as I am and generally a reminder that I\u2019m not going insane. So when we finally get off work my brother shows up to give us both lift home (for some reason he had a mullet) in this tiny little electric car.<br /> He drops her off; he drops me off and just as I think I\u2019ve reached the pinnacle of crazy I come home to be greeted by ten robots who tell me that the woman I was with was how their mom sees herself in her dreams<br /> I guess I was supposed to be their mother which makes the whole thing very meta.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>success is the ability to go from one failure to the next without any loss of enthusiasm","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1115-the-hug-ninja","name":"The Hug Ninja","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1115_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"324"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-26T09:05:47-08:00","id":382051,"title":"","content":"Had my first lucid dream in years today. I was sleeping on the train on the way in to work, like I usually do, but in my dream I was driving (and stuck in traffic). I noticed the muscle discomfort that comes from the awkward sleeping on a train bench, and it pulled my mind out of the reverie of the dream. I shifted my dreamcar into <i>up</i> and flew around the imaginary cityscape for a time. It was glorious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T04:39:38-08:00","id":384116,"title":"","content":"You know, it's kind of creepy in hindsight if you remember that childhood dream about bizarre goblin like creatures trying to abduct you and then you become familiar with Changeling: The Lost. Thankfully there was a 'knight' in the dream to protect me and fend them off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T05:01:23-08:00","id":384127,"title":"","content":"If you want to twist itself back on &quot;creepy&quot;, both the knight and the goblins were probably the same entity messing with you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T05:12:37-08:00","id":384130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> If you want to twist itself back on &quot;creepy&quot;, both the knight and the goblins were probably the same entity messing with you. </div> </div> </div>If that happened to me now, given my perception of knights got utterly &quot;ruined&quot; by Nasuverse, I would summon a Servant.<br /> <br /> Which reminds me that Fate/strange/fake's Rider was summoned in a dream.<br /> <br /> Surely I would prefer Siegfried as my Servant since a true hero of justice or Mordred since I would be up for having a tomboyish younger cousin/sibling substitute with an attitude.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":2918,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","user":"Kat","date":". 01-28-2015, 08:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T03:28:45-07:00","id":433771,"title":"","content":"I just dreamed a Wes Anderson film. Edward Norton stars as a man struggling to make his way in the world of high finance with a chronic illness that occasionally results in explosive diarrhea and/or vomiting. The movie opens as a documentary team is finishing up filming a biopic of his life story. The film goes on to be a critical success but a financial failure, the construction crew that is renovating his house competes to see who can purchase unopened copies for the lowest price (the winner is the man who spackles the ceilings, he scores a copy for 61 cents from a video store whose water main broke. Not wanting to relive some of the more embarrassing moments in the film, Edward Norton's character avoids watching it, only to discover that everyone else in his life has seen it and, empowered by his struggles and the moral the director included in the film (don't cross or avoid mountains, create valleys), they are surpassing his every success. When he can no longer afford the construction crew and goes to fire them, they are ecstatic because they have since tripled their rates and all married Russian brides as a result of being in this film, and were only completing the job at their earlier rate out of loyalty to him.<br /> <br /> Penniless and desperate, he watches the film only to discover that a glitch in the crediting has resulted in him receiving a much smaller share of the film's meager profits than originally contracted. He uses this seed money -- and his own moral from the experience of being in the film -- to seek out a second attempt at success.<br /> <br /> <br /> -fin-","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T08:45:36-07:00","id":437077,"title":"","content":"And you're starting on the script when?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{